  m_text: 'Forest Falls is the greatest place to camp on this side of the country,
    with Mr Bear''s cozy cabin marking the best place to set up camp!


    The clearing
    to the east is perfect to pick up logs and branches for a campfire!


    Lastly,
    the waterfall pond up north is teeming with fish! Maybe you should try and catch
    one?'
